4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:22.060
War bonds, but backwards. The Core Problem: Good Ideas Die in Committee.

5
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:26.800
Here's your species' fun puzzle: you know how to save millions of lives.

6
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.540
You can measure exactly how many. You have the money. You don't do it.

7
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:40.320
Not because your politicians are evil. Because your system is built so that: Politicians maximize reelection, status, and

8
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:49.420
